    "description": "<p>This short paper describes the &quot;Alligator&quot; Method, which converts the results of a CA into a relative chronology following Allen&#39;s interval algebra. This enables temporal reasoning and visualisation in graphs or timelines, as well as the export in standards such as RDF.</p>",
